        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-results-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Extend result meanings",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A result complement tells what an action achieves: 到 reaches, 住 holds, 走 removes, and 上 can establish attachment. The verb alone does not assert that result.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我找到书了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zhǎo dào shū le 。",
                "meaning": "I found the book.",
                "audio": "10cf90917c4b5132ebeb7792e972667d1e2317d78a85537dc4ff20096d312beb"
              },
              {
                "text": "请记住这个字。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng jì zhù zhè gè zì 。",
                "meaning": "Please remember this character.",
                "audio": "1c85a5345b9f9cb39fb5e5508c651e5df4b5667a6cc5cb093c6f1232b6f3fb4b"
              },
              {
                "text": "他拿走了书。",
                "pinyin": "tā ná zǒu le shū 。",
                "meaning": "He took the book away.",
                "audio": "1daa6bc8da26e5e3703ead77bba5d25242e39005608e362ad2b78b16e5b6d7de"
              },
              {
                "text": "我关上了门。",
